sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Clients
    participant LB as Router
    participant S1 as Server replica
    participant Batch as Running batch
    participant GPU as GPUs
    Cl->>LB: many concurrent requests
    LB->>S1: route by free KV cache, not round-robin
    S1->>Batch: admit if the cache budget allows
    loop each decode step
        Batch->>GPU: one forward pass for the whole batch
        GPU-->>Batch: a token for every sequence
        Batch-->>Cl: stream each one
    end
    Note over Batch: continuous batching — finished sequences leave, new ones join between steps
    alt cache is full
        S1-->>LB: reject or queue
        LB->>S1: try another replica
    end
    Note over LB,GPU: a model too big for one GPU is sharded — tensor parallel within a node, pipeline across nodes
